hadiths[4]{hadithnumber,text}:
"19155","Waki narrated to us: Hammad ibn Salama narrated to us, from Abu al-Ushara, from his father, he said: I said: O Messenger of Allah, is slaughter only in the throat or the hollow of the chest? He said: Had you stabbed in its thigh it would have sufficed you."
"19156","Affan narrated to us: Hammad ibn Salama narrated to us, from Abu al-Ushara, from his father, from the Prophet (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) the like. He said: And I heard him say: By your father."
"19157","Hudba ibn Khalid and Ibrahim ibn al-Hajjaj narrated to us, they said: Hammad ibn Salama narrated to us, he said: Abu al-Ushara narrated to us, from his father, from the Prophet (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) the like of the hadith of Waki."
"19158","Hawthara ibn Ashras narrated to us: Hammad ibn Salama narrated to us, then he mentioned like it."
